WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.377 --> 00:00:02.910
Unit nine. Bath Time!

2
00:00:03.873 --> 00:00:07.682
Hello, everyone! I'm Nurse Bopha, your school nurse.

3
00:00:07.732 --> 00:00:11.022
Hi, Nurse Bopha! What do we learn today?

4
00:00:11.072 --> 00:00:14.432
Today we learn about Bath Time. Let's go!

5
00:00:15.487 --> 00:00:18.587
Bath. Say it with me. Bath!

6
00:00:22.064 --> 00:00:25.414
Soap. Say it with me. Soap!

7
00:00:28.921 --> 00:00:32.405
Water. Say it with me. Water!

8
00:00:35.885 --> 00:00:39.202
Towel. Say it with me. Towel!

9
00:00:42.705 --> 00:00:45.855
Clean. Say it with me. Clean!

10
00:00:49.342 --> 00:00:52.442
Sweat. Say it with me. Sweat!

11
00:00:55.940 --> 00:00:59.206
Fresh. Say it with me. Fresh!

12
00:01:02.725 --> 00:01:06.741
Every day. Say it with me. Every day!

13
00:01:10.265 --> 00:01:18.227
I take a bath every day with soap and water. It washes away sweat and dirt. I dry myself with a clean towel and feel fresh.

14
00:01:18.276 --> 00:01:19.556
I can do that too!

15
00:01:20.783 --> 00:01:25.946
Look! What's the word?

16
00:01:25.996 --> 00:01:27.146
Water!

17
00:01:28.036 --> 00:01:33.307
Look! What's the word?

18
00:01:33.357 --> 00:01:34.507
Fresh!

19
00:01:35.367 --> 00:01:43.293
Did you know? Sweat itself has almost no smell — the smell comes from germs on the skin, which washing removes!

20
00:01:43.343 --> 00:01:45.383
Wow! I did not know that!

21
00:01:46.086 --> 00:01:53.421
Think and answer. Why do we take a bath every day?

22
00:01:53.471 --> 00:01:54.621
Great answer!

23
00:01:55.790 --> 00:02:00.639
Great job today! Stay healthy, and see you next time. Goodbye!

24
00:02:00.689 --> 00:02:03.420
Goodbye, everyone! Stay healthy!

